'''Ken-Yon Cedric Rambo''' (born October 4, 1978) is an American former professional [[gridiron football|football]] [[wide receiver]] who played in the [[Canadian Football League]] (CFL) and [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] at [[Ohio State University]]<!--Wikipedians do not use "The" as part of Ohio State's name; it is considered a marketing gimmick, and routinely deleted.-->.
